      "notes": "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks. Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer. This asset depicts the exact retained manufacturer assembly. Materials and unidentified component semantics are approximate; dimensions and all native relative placements remain unscaled. Packaged cameras, external display, speaker, PoE add-on, antenna cables and other optional accessories absent from sourceCAD are not fabricated as included geometry. Exact packaging remains in product knowledge. BOOT uses a verified product input control where present. No GPIO hit target is placed on an uncalibrated native component; bare modules do not gain a nonexistent button or codec. No Ethernet/radio/DSI/CSI/analog hardware or firmware execution is established by this mechanical model. Native source has no explicit16/32MiB SKUlabel. Its cornercomponent281 has a socket-like nativegeometry; comparison to officialno-IPEX photos showing an unpopulated RFfootprint supports selecting this component only for theIPEX option. This is visualcomponentclassification, not an identified connectorpart or certifiedSKUrevision. No-IPEX variant explicitly omits281; other281sourcecomponents remain unchanged. Manufacturer-datasheetPDF contains schematics, not placementdimensions. No-IPEX selection omits only the optionalcorner socket-likecomponent281. Empty pads and unresolvedfinepackage detail are not replaced with fabricatedantenna geometry."
